WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.620
Agar comes from seaweed, and
most bacteria cannot digest it.

2
00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.610
Mixed with nutrients and
poured hot into a dish,

3
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.120
it sets solid.

4
00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:13.510
On it, a single cell can grow
into a colony you can see.

5
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:18.950
But microbes drift in the air too, and
some bacteria cause disease in people.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.950
So how do you grow bacteria on
purpose, without growing anything else,

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.870
or infecting yourself?

8
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.560
In this mission, you'll list
what bacteria need to grow,

9
00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.850
from nutrients and water to a suitable pH.

10
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:36.190
Then you'll dilute a culture
tenfold, then tenfold again,

11
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.870
and see why the factors multiply.

12
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:42.900
Your mission: find out how to
grow just the bacteria you want,

13
00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:44.510
and keep everyone safe.
